# TTP-2026-0513 — Service Account Escalating to Root via su on the Linux Syslog Feed
# XQL paste-buffer generated by detection_scanner/scripts/export_artifacts.py

## VALIDATION — su Session Opened for root by a Non-Interactive Service Account
# purpose: validation
# dataset: linux_syslog

dataset = linux_syslog
| filter process = "su" and message contains "session opened for user root"
| comp count() as c by user, host
| filter c >= 1

